      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Failure behaviour: design intentions, to be tested",
      "originalText": "Failure behaviour: design intentions, to be tested",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "te54",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 830,
      "width": 1263.3600000000001,
      "height": 160.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1426256014,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 139586394,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Runtime node dies mid-task: no receipt, so the task is Failed and escrow returns. Resuming is open (D7) because side effects already happened\nTEE measurement revoked or key compromised: stop accepting it; receipts committed under it are flagged for audit at p = 1\nReceipt store unavailable: audit and challenge are blocked, so an unreachable body counts as failure and escrow returns\nValidator service down: no audits are drawn. Proposed: hold release while validation is unavailable beyond a threshold, and alert\nChain congestion or fee spike: commitments are delayed; signed pre-commitments cover the gap; batch interval is adjustable per category\nChain reorg: wait for finality before release; the indexer is reorg-safe, and settlement never reads the indexer\nLLM provider outage: fail the task cleanly; no partial-credit receipt\nControl plane down: no new tasks, but in-flight escrow and windows are enforced on chain, so money does not depend on its uptime",
      "originalText": "Runtime node dies mid-task: no receipt, so the task is Failed and escrow returns. Resuming is open (D7) because side effects already happened\nTEE measurement revoked or key compromised: stop accepting it; receipts committed under it are flagged for audit at p = 1\nReceipt store unavailable: audit and challenge are blocked, so an unreachable body counts as failure and escrow returns\nValidator service down: no audits are drawn. Proposed: hold release while validation is unavailable beyond a threshold, and alert\nChain congestion or fee spike: commitments are delayed; signed pre-commitments cover the gap; batch interval is adjustable per category\nChain reorg: wait for finality before release; the indexer is reorg-safe, and settlement never reads the indexer\nLLM provider outage: fail the task cleanly; no partial-credit receipt\nControl plane down: no new tasks, but in-flight escrow and windows are enforced on chain, so money does not depend on its uptime",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "li55",
      "type": "line",
